Synthetic-vs-real structural comparison (reviewer-requested calibration of the
20,000-node scale claim). 5 real datasets (cached objects run_baselines.py scores)
+ 2 synthetic configurations: 'synthetic_typical' (generator defaults, matches
demo.py/README) and 'synthetic_stress20k' (literal run_scale.py Part A 20k-node config).

