Notes per row:
  crisismmd: real dataset (cached, same object run_baselines.py scores)
  pheme: real dataset (cached, same object run_baselines.py scores)
  fakeddit: real dataset (cached, same object run_baselines.py scores)
  dblp: real dataset (cached, same object run_baselines.py scores); content: no per-node content in this dataset
  amazon: real dataset (cached, same object run_baselines.py scores); content: no per-node content in this dataset
  synthetic_typical: synthetic generator's OWN defaults (n_nodes=120, n_communities=4, p_in=0.18, p_out=0.02, missing_modality_rate=0.15, misalignment_rate=0.15, overlap_rate=0.10) -- the configuration demo.py/README.md/validate_onmi.py all use
  synthetic_stress20k: LITERAL run_scale.py Part A config for its 20,000-node headline result: n_communities=8, p_in=0.00405, p_out=0.00045 (target avg degree ~18), missing/misalignment/overlap all forced to 0
